所以我这样的人就是没有成事之才的，我会因为一时的成就或者失败而影响整体进度。识别人和识自己一样，优秀的成功者身上都会有一个共同点：自驱力。这个很重要，非常重要。</span></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 empty:hidden"></div><div class="-mx-2 flex h-5 min-h-5 w-[calc(100%+16px)] items-center justify-between overflow-visible @container"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" data-engagement-action="reply"><a class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] group inline-flex items-center rounded-full transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 hover:text-blue-500 text-secondary" aria-label="Reply" href="/pupubtc/status/1912423162828189926"><span class="relative isolate inline-flex items-center rounded-full before:-z-10 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-full before:scale-[0.88] before:opacity-[0] before:transition-[opacity,scale] before:duration-[140ms] before:ease-[ease-out] group-hover:before:scale-100 group-hover:before:opacity-[1] motion-reduce:before:transition-none before:bg-blue-500/10 h-9 px-2.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-[18px]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-reply-stroke" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.751 10c0-4.42 3.584-8 8.005-8h4.366c4.49 0 8.129 3.64 8.129 8.13 0 2.96-1.607 5.68-4.196 7.11l-8.054 4.46v-3.69h-.067c-4.49.1-8.183-3.51-8.183-8.01zm8.005-6c-3.317 0-6.005 2.69-6.005 6 0 3.37 2.77 6.08 6.138 6.01l.351-.01h1.761v2.3l5.087-2.81c1.951-1.08 3.163-3.13 3.163-5.36 0-3.39-2.744-6.13-6.129-6.13H9.756z"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" data-engagement-action="retweet"><button type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_fdbnjimb6b5336_" data-slot="xds-menu-trigger" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" aria-label="Repost" aria-pressed="false" class="group inline-flex items-center rounded-full transition-colors focus-visible: